## 5. Recommendations Based on the Research

1. Conduct regular employee phishing awareness training.
2. Implement multi-factor authentication for organisational accounts.
3. Monitor unusual login attempts and account activity.
4. Audit email forwarding rules regularly.
5. Use appropriate email filtering and security controls.
6. Monitor unusual file modifications on critical systems.
7. Maintain protected backups and test restoration procedures.
8. Document incident response actions and lessons learned.

